---
import Layout from "../../../layouts/Layout.astro";

import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import news from "../../../data/news/news-2025.js";
import img_Featured from "../../../assets/news/2025/beauty-up-for-adoption.jpg";
import { Icon } from "astro-icon/components";
import { ViewTransitions } from "astro:transitions";

const article = news[16];
const { author, title, content, img, date, id } = article;
---

<ViewTransitions />
<Layout title=`${title} - Fallen Oak`>
  <div
    class="bg-[#fefce8] min-h-[calc(100vh-10rem)] px-4 lg:px-0 flex flex-col items-center"
  >
    <a
      class="mt-24 duration-300 hover:bg-blue-200 bg-blue-50 border-2 border-blue-200 hover:border-blue-400 rounded font-semibold text-base px-3 py-1 flex items-center gap-x-2"
      href="../"
      ><Icon name="mdi:arrow-back" class="text-2xl text-blue-600" />Back to News</a
    >
    <div class="w-full lg:w-1/2 mx-auto py-8">
      <article class="px-6 mx-auto flex flex-col lg:flex-col gap-x-12 gap-y-8">
        <div class="flex justify-center w-full lg:w-full">
          <Image 
          transition:name={id} src={img_Featured} alt="News" width="400" class="object-cover w-auto h-64 border-2 rounded border-black" />
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-y-8 w-full lg:w-full">
          <div class="flex flex-col mx-auto gap-y-2 w-full">
            <h1 class="text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-semibold leading-none whitespace-wrap">{title}</h1>
            <p class="text-xs lg:text-sm">
              by
              <span class="text-blue-400">
                <span>{author}</span>
              </span>on
              <time datetime="2021-02-12 15:34:18-0200">{date}</time>
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-y-4 lg:text-base text-sm rounded border border-dashed border-black p-4 bg-amber-100">
            <!-- <p>{content}</p> -->
            <p>Beauty, aka Phantom Girl, is a 15-year-old off the track thoroughbred. Beauty stands 16’3, is currently barefoot, and is up-to-date on everything.</p>
            <p>Beauty is an incredible mover, has potential for jumping is ridden both English and western, but would love to see her go to an English riding home, where she can excel and be shown. Beauty was returned by a prior adopter after 6 weeks, as she was too much horse for her 8-year-old.</p>
            <p>Beauty is fine for a child as long as they are a confident rider. Beauty is currently located at our trainers in Ocala. We have tons of riding videos we can send you. If you would like to come see her, please reach out. Let’s find this sweet girl her forever home. Adoption fee is $1,200.</p>
        </div>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
